(6922,'向新国王致敬！','',9455,0,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,'When I scowled at you before you became da new king... um... I was just joking.$B$BYeah!','',9456,0,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dem other ogres was dumb to attack you, boss!  Dat\'s why I\'m still alive - I\'m smart and stuff!','',9457,0,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We a lot cleaner than da ogres in Tanaris.  All over da desert as far as da eye can see - ogre poo.  Not here, no $g sir : ma\'am;!','',9458,0,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So long as you stay here with us, you da king.  You take off, and some other ogre will take your place.  That\'s da way of da Gordok!','',9459,0,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am so smart!  S-M-R-T!','',9460,0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Old king got dead?  That\'s unpossible!','',9461,0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I cause you no trouble, boss.','',9462,0,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,11723),
