(15140,'你觉得我们什么时候能走？我得回去干活了。','你觉得我们什么时候可以离开?我必须回去工作。',37066,0,1,0,6,0,0,0,0,'Where are all these troggs coming from?  Were they livin\' underground the whole time?','Where are all these troggs coming from?  Were they livin\' underground the whole time?',37067,0,1,0,6,0,0,0,0,'Might as well make yerself comfortable.  Ironstock\'s not lettin\' anybody out until the troggs die down.','Might as well make yerself comfortable.  Ironstock\'s not lettin\' anybody out until the troggs die down.',37068,0,1,0,1,0,0,0,0,'Have ye any news from outside?  I hear the trolls have been actin\' up too.','Have ye any news from outside?  I hear the trolls have been actin\' up too.',37069,0,1,0,1,0,0,0,0,'It\'s gettin\' awful crowded in here.  I don\'t do well in confined spaces.','It\'s gettin\' awful crowded in here.  I don\'t do well in confined spaces.',37070,0,1,0,1,0,0,0,0,'Ye\'d think that, after an earthquake of cataclysmic proportions, the LAST place ye\'d want ta be is indoors, wouldn\'t ye?','Ye\'d think that, after an earthquake of cataclysmic proportions, the LAST place ye\'d want ta be is indoors, wouldn\'t ye?',37071,0,1,0,5,0,0,0,0,'$N!  I hear you\'re Ironstock\'s new little whipping $r.  What\'s she got ya doin\' now?','$N!  I hear you\'re Ironstock\'s new little whipping $r.  What\'s she got ya doin\' now?',37072,0,1,0,1,0,0,0,0,'I feel like I\'ve been cooped up in here forever.  Is it Brewfest yet?','I feel like I\'ve been cooped up in here forever.  Is it Brewfest yet?',37073,0,1,0,5,0,0,0,0,0),
