(15696,'你成功了！我们得救了！','你办到了!我们得救了!',39625,0,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Are we really finally going to Azshara? Is there a volcano there, too?','Are we really finally going to Azshara? Is there a volcano there, too?',39626,0,1,6,0,0,0,0,0,'我该怎么谢你呢，$N？','我该怎么谢你呢，$N？',39627,0,1,6,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'d keep my eyes and ears open if I were you. There\'s a rumor going around that you caused both Mount Kajaro and the Lost Isles volcanoes to explode.$B$BCrazy, I know. But people will gossip about anything and love to tear down their heroes, especially if there\'s a chance for profit and promotion.','I\'d keep my eyes and ears open if I were you. There\'s a rumor going around that you caused both Mount Kajaro and the Lost Isles volcanoes to explode.$B$BCrazy, I know. But people will gossip about anything and love to tear down their heroes, especially if there\'s a chance for profit and promotion.',39628,0,1,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s leave dock before the volcano destroys us all!','Let\'s leave dock before the volcano destroys us all!',39629,0,1,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Ready to go when you are, $g sir : ma\'am;!','Ready to go when you are, $g sir : ma\'am;!',39630,0,1,66,0,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t know. I think I\'m going to miss this place. We had some pretty good times here.','I don\'t know. I think I\'m going to miss this place. We had some pretty good times here.',39631,0,1,6,0,0,0,0,0,'I have an idea... this time let\'s not wander through a naval battle between the Alliance and the Horde.$B$BI\'m just saying.','I have an idea... this time let\'s not wander through a naval battle between the Alliance and the Horde.$B$BI\'m just saying.',39632,0,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),
